{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1791690480, "covers_from": "2026-10-11T03:48:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-11T03:49:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1791690540, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-11T03:48:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "queue_number": 60913, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "songshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "台北市的腳踏車道不夠完善\n常常要在馬路上跟汽機車爭道\n在人行道上的腳踏車道又會一段有一段沒有", "display_name": "松山代表 No.60,913", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-11T03:48:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 9, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 18164, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "環境", "content": "希望台北市的樹都好好的，讓動物們一起跟我們生存在這個城市", "display_name": "大安代表 No.18,164", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-11T03:48:24+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 39651, "sprite_key": "turtle_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "其他", "content": "以前會很以台北人自豪，覺得我們的城市交通很方便，建設跟管理很好，但近年來已沒有了繼續進步的感覺", "display_name": "信義代表 No.39,651", "mood": "hopeful", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-11T03:48:39+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 57520, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "交通", "content": "新兒童樂園每到週末假日附近停車場入口都大排長龍。應響往來交通和行人安全。是否附近蓋個大型多層停車場。", "display_name": "士林代表 No.57,520", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-11T03:48:54+00:00", "duration_seconds": 6, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 11820, "sprite_key": "deer_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "其他", "content": "當選台北市長，解決市民問題🙋", "display_name": "大安代表 洪仲信", "mood": "hopeful", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 18164, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "display_name": "大安代表 No.18,164", "district": "daan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 39651, "sprite_key": "turtle_business", "display_name": "信義代表 No.39,651", "district": "xinyi", "is_replay": true, "frozen":